438	   304	 *   - OAuth creds → refreshed via the refresh token when expired/near-expiry,
439	   305	 *     with the new blob re-encrypted back into `User.cloudflareTokenEnc`.
440	   306	 *
441	   307	 * Returns `{ error }` (never throws) for "nothing connected" and for a refresh
442	   308	 * failure, so callers surface a friendly reconnect prompt instead of crashing.
443	   309	 * `lib/cloudflare-dns.ts` keeps its per-call token signature — we just feed it
444	   310	 * whatever this returns.
